# Client-only Tor profile for the isolated Uroboros 0.5 Docker network.
ClientOnly 1
ORPort 0
DirPort 0
BridgeRelay 0
ExitRelay 0
PublishServerDescriptor 0

SocksPort 172.30.75.2:9050 IsolateSOCKSAuth
SocksPolicy accept 172.30.75.0/24
SocksPolicy reject *
SafeSocks 1
TestSocks 1
ClientRejectInternalAddresses 1
AutomapHostsOnResolve 0

RunAsDaemon 0
AvoidDiskWrites 1
DataDirectory /var/lib/tor
PidFile /run/tor/tor.pid
Log notice stdout
